},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"U","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Equatable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SQ","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","title":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"code":"origami.Drag","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"code":"Position","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/symbolEffect(_:options:value:)":{"role":"symbol","title":"symbolEffect(_:options:value:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/symboleffect(_:options:value:)","abstract":[],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/symbolEffect(_:options:value:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"symbolEffect"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"U"},{"kind":"text","text